# App signing material from the PWABuilder package. This repo is public, and
# the keystore plus its password is everything needed to publish a forged
# update under this app's identity. It is also unrecoverable — losing it means
# never being able to update the app again. Keep it in offline backup only.
*.aab
*.keystore
*.jks
signing-key-info.txt
*.pepk
*.p12
*.pem
